WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.630
Late on a Saturday night,
in a busy town centre,

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.520
a young woman can't walk in her shoes.

3
00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.400
A volunteer hands her
flip-flops and water,

4
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.200
and waits with her until help arrives.

5
00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.580
The volunteer is a street
pastor from a local church,

6
00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.250
who won't preach unless someone asks.

7
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.350
So what is a church for, when most of
its neighbours never come to a service?

8
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.450
In this mission, you'll see the difference
between a church with a small c,

9
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.870
and the Church with a capital C.

10
00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:34.100
Then you'll visit a food bank, and weigh
up whether the local church is still

11
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.110
the heart of its community.

12
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:39.970
Your mission: find out what
a local church is for today.
